@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam roundCorner 10

title EduCore — Audit Log Capture & Review Pipeline

actor "User / Admin" as Actor
participant "EduCore Controller" as App
participant "AuditService" as Audit
database "PostgreSQL DB" as DB
actor "Super Admin" as SuperAdmin

== Automated Event Capture ==
Actor -> App : Performs privileged mutation (e.g. Update Grade, Delete User)
App -> DB : Perform DB mutation
App -> Audit : Log auditable event
Audit -> DB : Insert audit_logs row (event, old_values, new_values, ip, user_agent)
App --> Actor : Confirm mutation

== Audit Log Review ==
SuperAdmin -> App : Open /audit-logs with filters
App -> DB : Fetch filtered audit records
App --> SuperAdmin : Render paginated table with JSON payload inspector
SuperAdmin -> App : Click 'Export CSV'
App --> SuperAdmin : Stream audit_logs.csv

@enduml
